  "summary": "A management platform for a bakery chain with five retail locations, an in-house delivery fleet (10 drivers, 10 bikes, 2 cars, ~300 deliveries/day), and central management. It centralizes stock and inventory management per shop, order and delivery dispatch, driver and vehicle scheduling, and performance analytics. It also provides a knowledge layer that accepts uploaded documents (later: unit prices and operating procedures) and answers operational questions once those documents are provided.",
